prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Aggrieved Woman / Complainant most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Committee may graciously be pleased to:

a) Initiate an inquiry against the Respondent in accordance with Section 11 of the Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal) Act, 2013 and the Service Rules / POSH Rules 2013 applicable;

b) Pending the inquiry, grant interim relief to the Complainant under Section 12 of the Act, including {specific_interim_relief};

c) Upon conclusion of the inquiry and on finding the allegations established, recommend action against the Respondent under Section 13 of the Act, including {specific_final_relief};

d) Direct payment of compensation to the Complainant under Section 13(3)(b) read with Section 15 of the Act;

e) Ensure strict confidentiality under Section 16 of the Act throughout the proceedings;

f) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Committee may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Aggrieved Woman / Complainant shall ever pray.
